<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  SYNTHETIC F9 FIXTURE. Not JLR evidence and not promotable to evidence.

  The Russian sibling of f9_dtc_help.xml (ADR-0034): the same code, the same
  selections, the same screens and the same mnemonic names, with the human
  text in invented Russian — the shape of SDD's language packs, which share
  everything but the words. Two things are exercised on purpose:

    * the document declares isoCode="ru", which the adapter requires when it
      is told to read a pack as Russian;
    * SYNTH_ACTION_1 has no Russian text here, so the line it fills on the
      MY06 screen must keep its English when the two are joined by name.
-->
